            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESingle room supplement \u00A3199\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EInsurance (including Covid cover) \u00A392\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGratuities\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDinners on Days 2, 3 \u0026amp; 4\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELunches\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDonations at any churches or cathedrals visited\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EPrice based on twin share.\u003Cbr\u003EMinimum numbers required.\u003Cbr\u003ENormal booking conditions apply.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
